# Quirri product UI rules (always)

**Full contract:** `docs/QUIRRI_PRODUCT_UI_RULES.md`

## Product must-haves

1. No mocks in `src/` for portals — loading / error / empty only  
2. One Amber 700 CTA per view  
3. Forms: `FIELD_RULES` + `QuirriRHFField` (`fieldType`) — see `quirri-forms.mdc`  
4. No native HTML `title` tooltips — use `QuirriTooltip` / `useQuirriTip`  
5. WCAG 2.2 AA; calm sentence-case copy  
6. Missing backend epic → empty/error (see `docs/BACKEND_STATUS_REPORT.md`)  
7. Playwright-check UI changes after portal login  
8. Post-login UI follows **`docs/agent/design-system.md`** (Brand v1.0 + Quirri Prep patterns); module/nav content from `new_updated_design_four/` (`docs/QUIRRI_UI_REFERENCE.md`); login cards stay existing centered pattern  
9. Portal font Poppins 400/500; canvas `#EEF0F0`; **white** sidebar (Ink text, Teal 50 active fill + Teal 500 label); 6px controls · 8px cards · 16px modals  

## Dropdown (“drop”) rules

- Use **`QuirriSelect`** custom listbox (`src/components/superadmin/QuirriSelect.jsx`) — **not** the OS native `<select>` menu (cannot brand; shows system blue)
- Long searchable lists (India state/district): **`QuirriCombobox`** — type-to-filter; same chrome as QuirriSelect
- Trigger: white, 6px radius, 1px Neutral 200, 44px · Menu: white, 8px radius, `--shadow-md`; selected row = teal-50 + check — never browser blue
- Forms/modals: **visible label above** (sentence case)
- Toolbar filters: visible label optional **only** with `aria-label`
- First option: `All …` (filters) or `Select …` (required forms), `value=""`
- Min-height 44px; teal focus; left-aligned text; keyboard + click-outside
- Immutable fields stay visible + `disabled`  

## Text allocation & alignment

- **Left-align** titles, labels, body, hints, table text  
- **Right-align** numeric cells (`.num`) with tabular nums  
- **Center** only the auth login brand card  
- Stack: label → control → hint **or** error  
- Section head: title/description left, actions right  
- Toolbar (filter bar): Teal 500 card, search flexes, selects `min-width: 168px`, Clear = Teal 400, primary = Amber 700  
- Forms: `grid2` / `QuirriFormGrid`; long fields `full`  
- Spacing: 4px scale only  

## Forbidden

- Centered product form labels or table body text  
- Per-page one-off select styling  
- Fake dropdown data / fake dashboard numbers  
- All-caps UI titles or vague errors (“Invalid input.”)  

Before finishing UI work: run the checklist in `docs/QUIRRI_PRODUCT_UI_RULES.md` §4.
